WHAT THIS FORK ADDS
------------------------------------------------------------------------

All of the following are new work, not present upstream.

NEW FILES
  studio.css                      UI theme + responsive layout for the workbench
  src/studio/studio.js            orchestration layer, panel UI, isolate/frame
  src/studio/section.js           live cross-section with stencil-buffer caps
  src/studio/explode.js           exploded view (radial / axis) with easing
  src/studio/tree.js              interactive part hierarchy with tri counts
  src/studio/annotations.js       3D anchors + DOM labels + SVG leader lines
  src/studio/measure.js           two-point measurement with vertex snapping
  src/studio/project.js           project JSON serialization + PNG capture
  assets/models/RoboticArm.glb    procedurally generated sample (CC0-1.0)
  tools/make_sample.py            generator for the sample model
  tools/verify.mjs                19 end-to-end assertions (Playwright)
  tools/shots.mjs                 screenshot generator
  tools/fetch_models.py           resumable model downloader
  TECHNICAL.md                    implementation notes and pitfalls
  NOTICE                          this file

MODIFIED UPSTREAM FILES
  src/viewer.js
    - WebGLRenderer created with { stencil: true }
    - setURLModifier: pass through blob: / data: / http(s): URLs untouched
      (fixes embedded-texture loading for GLB files)
    - setContent: camera now frames the re-centred origin with a proper
      distance derived from the bounding sphere; respects the side panel
    - setViewOffset() / getEffectiveViewport(): frame the model inside the
      area not covered by the workbench panel (right dock or bottom drawer)
    - onContent / onClear / onFrame / onResize lifecycle hooks for Studio

  src/app.js
    - parses ?model= query string in addition to #model= hash
    - creates the Viewer + Studio eagerly so the panel exists before load
    - viewer element is attached to .wrap; the dropzone becomes an overlay
    - passes the loaded file name through to Studio for export naming

  src/validator.js
    - setReportException() no longer calls the never-defined this.toggleTpl;
      it renders the ValidatorToggle component instead. Upstream would throw
      a secondary TypeError and abort the whole load chain.

  index.html
    - loads studio.css
    - Chinese copy for the dropzone, plus a sample-model deep link

  README.md
    - rewritten for this fork

UNCHANGED UPSTREAM FILES
  style.css, src/environments.js, src/components/*, public/favicon.ico,
  cors.json, vercel.json, .prettierrc.json, and all three.js usage patterns
  that the new modules do not need to touch.

